        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6u4",
          "text": "If you or a loved one has been diagnosed with a brain injury after an accident in Thornton, Colorado, don’t hesitate to contact the experienced Thornton brain injury attorneys at ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6u6",
          "text": "Dormer Harpring, LLC",
          "marks": [
            "l6u5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6u7",
          "text": " for assistance. We have years of experience handling brain injury claims and know what it takes to secure the results that our clients need. We can help you through the legal process with tailored legal counsel and compassionate customer care.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6ua",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6u9",
          "text": "Why Should I Hire a Thornton Brain Injury Lawyer?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6uc",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6ub",
          "text": "Brain injuries are often catastrophic, meaning they impact a victim for the foreseeable future. A catastrophic brain injury can come with hundreds of thousands of dollars in necessary medical care, including surgeries, physical therapy, and rehabilitation. This is why it is critical to obtain the financial compensation that your family deserves during a brain injury lawsuit.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6uh",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l6ue",
          "_type": "link",
