      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6vz",
          "text": "If one or more parties reasonably could have prevented the incident that resulted in a victim’s brain injury, the victim may be eligible for financial compensation. The basis for a brain injury lawsuit is often negligence, or the failure to exercise ordinary care. If you or your attorney can prove negligence in association with your brain injury, you may receive the financial recovery that you need to move forward.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6w2",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6w1",
          "text": "What Compensation is Available After a Brain Injury in Thornton?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6w4",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6w3",
          "text": "Filing a claim or lawsuit against the party responsible for causing the injury can result in compensation for many different past and future losses from the at-fault party’s insurance provider. The financial compensation available in a brain injury case could pay for medical bills, pain and suffering, lost wages, lost capacity to earn, permanent disability, legal fees, and punitive damages. The value of your case will depend on factors such as injury severity and the cost of your required medical care.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6w6",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6w5",
          "text": "Contact Our Thornton Brain Injury Attorneys Today For a Free Consultation",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "b6wb",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_key": "l6w8",
          "_type": "link",
