        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6w7",
          "text": "For more information about a potential brain injury lawsuit, arrange a free consultation with an experienced and compassionate attorney at Dormer Harpring. We care about you, your family, and your future, and will only charge legal fees if we win your case. Find out how we can help you in more detail during a free initial case evaluation. ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6w9",
          "text": "Contact us online",
          "marks": [
            "l6w8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s6wa",
          "text": " or call (303) 747-4404 today to speak to a Thornton brain injury attorney.",
